{"id":"fb0405497b16b145","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-skolem-hull.md","title":"ZFC Skolem Hull","display":"df-zfc-skolem-hull — ZFC Skolem Hull","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-skolem-hull","aliases":["58-df-zfc-skolem-hull","58-df-zfc-inner4-skolem-hull","58-df-zfc-logic9-skolem-hull","58-df-zfc-model2-skolem-hull","58-df-zfc-model5-skolem-hull"],"display":"df-zfc-skolem-hull — ZFC Skolem Hull","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-skolem-hull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-skolem-hull</span><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-skolem-hull</span><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-skolem-hull</span><span>58-df-zfc-model2-skolem-hull</span><span>58-df-zfc-model5-skolem-hull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-skolem-hull — ZFC Skolem Hull"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91b4c987294d365f\" href=\"?note=91b4c987294d365f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-skolem-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,H,K,M,\\mathcal{F}\">\\(A,H,K,M,\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (set parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S\\)</span> (model-relative helper predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\)</span> (Skolem-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91b4c987294d365f\" href=\"?note=91b4c987294d365f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-skolem-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}\\)</span> are the canonical function and structure operations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap H^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\\Bigl((A\\subseteq K\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap K^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in K))\\to H\\subseteq K\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap H^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\\Bigl((A\\subseteq K\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap K^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in K))\\to H\\subseteq K\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}skolem} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S(H,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land H\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\land\\forall f,\\varphi\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\\to\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap H^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}skolem} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S(H,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land H\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\land\\forall f,\\varphi\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\\to\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap H^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S(H,M)\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;((A\\subseteq K\\land\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S(K,M))\\to H\\subseteq K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S(H,M)\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;((A\\subseteq K\\land\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S(K,M))\\to H\\subseteq K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S(M,A,H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S(M,A,H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S(M,A,H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S(M,A,H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S(H,A,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generic hull is the least superset closed under a supplied family of typed functions; the model hull is the least carrier subset closed under every sourced Skolem function.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-inner4-skolem-hull</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-logic9-skolem-hull</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-model2-skolem-hull</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-model5-skolem-hull</code> are exact argument-order aliases of the model hull.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function","status":"resolved","id":"91b4c987294d365f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function","status":"resolved","id":"91b4c987294d365f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S$ (Skolem-function predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"A,H,K,M,\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelSkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedUnderSkolem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9SkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2SkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5SkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap H^{<\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in H)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\\Bigl((A\\subseteq K\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap K^{<\\omega}\\;(f(\\bar a)\\in K))\\to H\\sub